{"id":"ocean-voyage-web-autonomous-build-up-v1","gameId":"ocean-voyage","target":"web","unityWebDevelopment":false,"department":"development","type":"implementation","designChange":false,"designScope":null,"proposedDesignChanges":[],"designFields":[],"assetProductionLane":false,"presentationPass":null,"graphicsReplacementContract":null,"motionRepairWorkUnit":null,"executionLane":"RELEASE_WAIT","goal":"[WEB_AUTONOMOUS_BUILD_UP] ocean-voyage 세대 1 / CORE_FUN\n핵심 조작→행동→결과의 재미와 적 대응을 기존 게임 규칙 안에서 강화한다. 적·보스·NPC AI가 실제 존재하는 게임에서는 인식·거리 유지·추격·회피·측면 이동·협동·공격 시점의 실패를 기존 AI 책임 함수에서 수리하고 실제 플레이로 검증한다. 체력·공격력·드롭·보상·밸런스 수치·엔진 판정·저장은 변경하지 않는다.\n검증된 전 세대·현재 소스·승인 설계·실제 플레이 문제를 비교해 한 가지 일관된 게임 기능 아이디어를 선택하고 기존 함수에 실제 구현한다. 문서·라벨·검증 버튼만 변경해 완료 처리하지 않는다. 기존 게임 정체성·밸런스·성벽/경제/동맹 같은 핵심 기능·저장 키와 저장 의미를 임의로 변경하지 않는다. 승인 근거 없는 신규 밸런스 변경은 금지한다. 해당 게임의 기존 BUILD_UP→F0~F9 후보·모바일 브라우저·저장·회귀·정확한 소스 revision 검증 후에만 다음 세대로 이어간다. 새 큐·워크플로·래퍼·우회 배포를 만들지 않는다.\n기존 자동 플레이테스트 관측: {\"sourceRevision\":\"afc2cd4afad60764b36ce25f77456d38dbac9c72\",\"runtimePassed\":true,\"failureSignature\":null,\"finding\":null,\"responsibleSource\":null}\n\n[WORK PACKAGE AUTO-EXPANSION]\n1. 직접 관련 오류 처리·예외 경로와 실패 피드백을 보강한다.\n2. 현재 책임 시스템과 인벤토리·진행·전투·상호작용 중 실제 연결된 경로의 상태 일치를 확인하고 발견 문제를 수정한다.\n3. 성공·실패·상태 변화 피드백을 실제 판정 시점과 맞추고 누락된 피드백을 보강한다.\n4. 모바일 입력·가독성·메뉴 흐름을 점검하고 현재 책임 범위의 발견 문제를 수정한다.","responsibleFiles":["web-games/ocean-voyage/index.html"],"retainedResponsibleFileLocks":[],"dependencies":[],"priority":"high","portfolioValueScore":0,"ownerDevelopmentHold":false,"ownerDevelopmentStopped":false,"securityReviewRequired":false,"securityQuarantined":false,"releaseState":"development-confirmed","status":"running","retries":0,"retryPolicy":"UNLIMITED_CAUSAL_REPAIR","maxRetries":null,"ownerDirective":false,"requiresOwnerDecision":false,"protectedChange":false,"paidResourceRequired":false,"productionMode":"AUTONOMOUS_VIBE","supervisionApproved":false,"supervisionContract":null,"supervisionReview":null,"blocker":"slot-released-awaiting-fan-in","evidence":["central-policy:/tmp/vibe2-main/company-learning/platform-release-roadmap.json","vibe2-auto-planner:game-catalog","release-state:development-confirmed","source-root:web-games/ocean-voyage","owner-resumable-build-up:YES","owner-resumable-build-up-source:catalog-owner-direct","owner-resumable-build-up-perpetual:YES","web-internal-priority:recent-owner-work","web-internal-priority-scope:WEB_ONLY","owner-recent-web-source-revision:771f6cc88938078b5ae658ca770603dbe47e664ba2de6143489d946f0e55e12e","web-autonomous-recurring-build-up:v1","web-recurring-focus:CORE_FUN","web-loop:EXISTING_BUILD_UP_F0_F9","real-source-diff-required","preserve-existing-save-and-rules","web-playtest-feedback:OBSERVED","runtime-neural-event:compiled","runtime-neural-event-platform:WEB","runtime-neural-event-platform-match:YES","runtime-neural-event-outcome:PASS","runtime-neural-event-authority:SHADOW","runtime-neural-event-action:OBSERVE_ONLY","neural-event-shadow:%7B%22version%22%3A3%2C%22eventIdentityVersion%22%3A2%2C%22authorityMode%22%3A%22SHADOW%22%2C%22eventId%22%3A%22ocean-voyage%7CRUNTIME_RESULT%7CWEB%7Cafc2cd4afad60764b36ce25f77456d38dbac9c72%7CPASS%7CTARGET_PLATFORM_RUNTIME%22%2C%22eventType%22%3A%22RUNTIME_RESULT%22%2C%22eventPlatform%22%3A%22WEB%22%2C%22actionKind%22%3A%22OBSERVE_ONLY%22%2C%22actionReason%22%3A%22INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE%22%2C%22wouldFireWithoutPhase2Authority%22%3Afalse%2C%22inhibitors%22%3A%5B%22ROOT_CAUSE_NOT_VERIFIED%22%5D%2C%22fireAllowed%22%3Afalse%2C%22workerCreationAllowed%22%3Afalse%2C%22queueMutationAllowed%22%3Afalse%2C%22waveReorderAllowed%22%3Afalse%2C%22automaticTuningAllowed%22%3Afalse%2C%22lockAcquisitionAllowed%22%3Afalse%2C%22policyMutationAllowed%22%3Afalse%2C%22authorityPromotionEligible%22%3Afalse%7D","neural-event-shadow-action:OBSERVE_ONLY","neural-work-graph-shadow:%7B%22version%22%3A2%2C%22authorityMode%22%3A%22SHADOW%22%2C%22graphId%22%3A%22ocean-voyage%7CRUNTIME_RESULT%7CWEB%7Cafc2cd4afad60764b36ce25f77456d38dbac9c